{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39089","headline":"下第题青龙寺僧房 · 韦庄","name":"下第题青龙寺僧房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千蹄万毂一枝芳，要路无媒果自伤。\n题柱未期归蜀国，曳裾何处谒吴王。\n马嘶春陌金羁闹，鸟睡花林绣羽香。\n酒薄恨浓消不得，却将惆怅问支郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}